{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / immutable audit base\nAt `origin/main@dcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d`, 12 lifecycle-interface files contain exactly 33 editable blocks: 25 true leading docstrings and 8 full-line comment regions, 3,187 before-words. The prior 32-block symbol/anchor inventory is preserved; `test_atomic_completion_close.py#D:_run_git` is the sole delta addition. Bracketed counts use `(?u)\\b[^\\W_]\\w*(?:[-'][^\\W_]\\w*)*\\b`.\n\n## Exact prose allowlist\n- `test_caused_by_autoderive_heldout.py` — `D:<module>@1-12[64]`.\n- `test_caused_by_autoderive.py` — `D:<module>@1-11[102]`.\n- `test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py` — `D:test_reactivate_child_reactivates_closed_parent@421-424[45]`, `D:test_every_table_edge_cascades_through_the_real_transition@618-632[144]`.\n- `test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py` — `D:<module>@1-21[216]`, `D:test_close_never_holds_the_lock_across_a_fold@139-151[126]`.\n- `test_close_symbolic_ref_pins_3e21.py` — `D:<module>@1-16[171]`.\n- `test_exit_codes.py` — `D:<module>@1-24[198]`, `D:_documented_subcommands@250-254[37]`, `D:test_every_live_route_is_documented_and_every_doc_row_names_a_real_route@277-294[156]`.\n- `test_force_unification_blusterous.py` — `D:<module>@1-15[131]`.\n- `test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py` — `D:<module>@1-25[221]`, `D:test_review_plan_own_material_change_cancels_mid_run@188-194[87]`.\n- `test_plan_review_gate.py` — `D:<module>@1-19[172]`, `C:<module>:before:_TP_SYMBOL@1288-1302[137]`, `D:_GroundingVerifierFake@1331-1336[56]`, `C:_GroundingVerifierFake._verification:before:return@1347-1354[85]`, `C:<module>:before:_capture_review_plan_kwargs@1544-1551[90]`, `D:_capture_review_plan_kwargs@1555-1559[48]`, `C:<module>:before:test_local_source_pass_is_never_signed@1811-1817[64]`, `C:test_local_source_pass_is_never_signed:before:reason assertion@1828-1829[23]`, `C:test_local_source_pass_is_never_signed:before:ticket assertion@1831-1832[17]`, `D:test_local_source_review_leaves_the_claim_gate_blocked@1837-1838[30]`, `D:test_no_signed_attestation_can_carry_a_null_verified_at_sha@1853-1856[48]`, `D:test_sign_review_refuses_to_resign_a_local_source_pass@1873-1876[49]`, `D:test_sign_review_recovery_binds_a_committed_verified_at_sha@1891-1893[38]`.\n- `test_ref_coherence.py` — `D:<module>@1-14[132]`, `C:_sign:before:from rebar import signing@68-72[44]`, `C:<module>:before:degraded-basis test@199-202[19]`, `D:test_attested_claim_gate_refuses_to_certify_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable@206-210[60]`, `D:test_pre_s4b_attestation_still_verifies_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable@252-261[97]`.\n- `test_transition_reason_honest_3803.py` — `D:<module>@1-28[245]`.\n- `test_atomic_completion_close.py` — `D:_run_git@43-48[35]`.\n\n## Contracts, consumers, and protected prose\nRetain caused-by derivation, parent cascades, atomic close/no-compaction, symbolic-ref pinning, exit-code documentation parity, force/reason separation, dependency/material invalidation, plan-review signing/grounding/local-source refusal, legacy/current hash-basis behavior, and git failure diagnosis. Consumers include pytest, lifecycle/claim/close gates, `docs/exit-codes.md`, plan-review status/signing coverage, and comment hygiene.\n\nAll unlisted prose is protected. In `test_atomic_completion_close.py`, keep the pre-existing module, `_git`, and `_bare_git` docstrings and every runtime diagnosis string. Preserve the eight claim-cascade `type: ignore[no-untyped-def]` lines, the exit-code attr-defined directive, two dependency-invalidation override directives, and three plan-review-gate override directives exactly.\n\n## Preservation and review contract\nCompare immutable `dcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:<path>` blobs with the final commit; filter changed-path checks to this leaf's 12 paths when multiple tickets share the commit. Parse Python with `ast.parse(..., type_comments=True)`; remove only the allowlisted leading owner docstrings; normalize only `ast.TypeIgnore.lineno`; require the remaining AST to match. Reject changes to inline or non-allowlisted comments. Preserve runtime strings, assertions, decorators, test data, shebangs, and every directive-bearing physical line exactly. Only adjacent blank-line normalization is allowed.\n\nA reviewer who did not author the leaf must post exactly 33 leaf-linked TSV rows:\n`stable_block_id<TAB>before_citation<TAB>final_citation<TAB>preserved_contract_or_consumer<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>semantic-preservation<TAB>bloat-removal<TAB>reviewer_session`.\nBefore citations use `dcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:<path>#<stable-id>`; final citations use `<full-final-sha>:<path>#<stable-id>`. Every row must have `after_words < before_words` and all three verdict fields PASS.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The path-scoped changed-path set from the grouped commit is exactly the 12-path file-impact set.\n- [ ] Only the 33 declared prose blocks and adjacent blank lines change.\n- [ ] The normalized non-docstring AST is identical on every impacted path.\n- [ ] Runtime strings and non-allowlisted comments remain byte-identical.\n- [ ] Directive and shebang physical lines remain byte-identical and attached.\n- [ ] The independent TSV has exactly 33 passing rows.\n- [ ] Every recorded DD command passes, including the no-timeout worktree-venv `make verify`.\n"}},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1792719835701587106,"uuid":"c44896e3-9af4-4758-9d91-087be2642414"}